Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:05.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}In the beginning God created\Nthe heaven and the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}And the earth was without form,\Nand void;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}and darkness was upon\Nthe face of the deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:20.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}And the Spirit of God moved\Nupon the face of the waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}And God said,\NLet there be light:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}and there was light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}And God saw the light,\Nthat it was good:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:42.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}and God divided the light\Nfrom the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:49.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}And God called the light Day,\Nand the darkness he called Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(150,150)}And the evening and the morning\Nwere the first day.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,768)\fad(500,400)\blur5}THE FIRST DAY
